# Skill files look like they have YAML frontmatter, but `parseSkillFile`
# (src/main/skills/skillFile.ts) is a hand-rolled flat `key: value` parser: it
# throws on any frontmatter line without a colon. Prettier formats the block as
# real YAML and reflows a long `keywords: [...]`/`tools: [...]` array onto a
# continuation line, which silently turns a valid skill into an unloadable one.
resources/skills/

# Archived UI exploration files; they are standalone prototypes, not production
# source. No longer tracked in git either, but they stay on disk and Prettier
# would otherwise still walk them.
docs/ui-samples/
